 r←Test_NoOrYes_003(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;msg;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "NoOrYes" with a question spanning several lines. Needs the user.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 msg←'Are you really sure about this?' '' 'This does not look right.'
 msg,←'In fact I think it is total rubbish.' 'I have never seen something similarly stupid.'
 msg,←'' 'I suggest you reconsider your decision.'
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForNoOrYes
 parms.addToCaption←'My caption'
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.DialogStyles.Error
 n←parms myGuiParms ∆NoOrYes msg
 ⎕DL 0.1
 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp(,n.∆buttons)[0]≢n.∆buttonPressed
 ⎕NQ n.Btn1'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp(,n.∆buttons)[1]≢n.∆buttonPressed
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
